  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEWEL Support to the implementation of the Zambia Social Cash Transfer Programme through a Multi-Donor Trust Fund (MDTF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In March 2020, FCDO Zambia signed an administrative arrangement with the World Bank which will enable FCDO to channel funds for SCTs through the Zambia Girls&apos; Education and Women&apos;s Empowerment and Livelihoods Project Multi-Donor Trust Fund. The main objective of the Project is to support the Government of Zambia to improve the effectiveness of its social protection system.</narrative>
  </description>
